(
    'Built insert and extractMin operations on the Mound with a driver harness for correctness verification across concurrent access patterns (MoundDSA, DSA coursework at BITS Pilani). The implementation uses C with low-level memory management — demonstrating understanding of pointer arithmetic, array-based tree representations, and concurrent data structure invariants.',
